[0.5.0] 2026-09-21 — ANIMATION — Motion system
================================================================================
- SmoothScroll.tsx — Lenis, duration 1.1, exponential ease-out. Routes in-page
  anchor clicks through Lenis for consistent easing. Disabled entirely under
  prefers-reduced-motion; cancels its rAF loop and listeners on unmount.
- motion-primitives.tsx — shared LUX_EASE cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) plus:
    Reveal       scroll-triggered fade/rise
    TextReveal   word-by-word headline reveal, optional gradient accent offset
    StaggerGrid  / StaggerItem — staggered grid entrances
    Parallax     scroll-linked depth drift (transform only, GPU-composited)
    ClipWipe     clip-path wipe transition between major sections
- MagneticButton.tsx — cursor-tracking magnetic pull on spring physics, with a
  sheen sweep on hover. Skipped for reduced-motion and coarse pointers.
- PlanCard.tsx — 3D tilt on mouse-move via sprung rotateX/rotateY, preserve-3d
  with the header/price/CTA lifted on translateZ, plus a cursor-tracking glare.
- Marquee.tsx — infinite ticker; duplicated track translating -50% on the
  compositor, no JS timer.
- FiberPath.tsx — SVG path-draw (pathLength) of the symmetrical fiber run, with
  two light pulses travelling in opposite directions to show 1:1 upload/download.
- BlackHole.tsx — Canvas 2D deep-space hero backdrop: dark core, photon ring,
  elliptical accretion band in the brand gradient, three-depth star field.
  NOT a 3D spiral. Performance guards: DPR capped at 1.5, star glow pre-rendered
  once into an offscreen sprite (avoids per-frame shadowBlur), particle counts
  scale with viewport area, rAF halts on tab-hide and on IntersectionObserver
  exit, single static frame under prefers-reduced-motion.
- Global @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) neutralizes all CSS animation.

