[1.0.1] 2026-09-21 — FIX — Header layout at the 1024–1280px band
================================================================================
Found during responsive QA at exactly 1024px (the old lg: breakpoint where the
desktop nav appeared): six nav links plus the full phone CTA did not fit, so
link labels and the CTA wrapped to three lines and burst the 76px header.
- Desktop nav and the mobile sheet toggle moved from lg: (1024px) to xl:
  (1280px). Between 1024 and 1280 the sheet handles navigation, leaving the
  logo and the full "Call (XXX) XXX-XXXX" CTA on one comfortable line.
